# ============================================================================
# 02_ Calculate tau (Yanai specificity index) — v3
# ============================================================================
# Consumes the outputs of scRNA_batch_pipeline.R (v8).
#
# WHAT CHANGED FROM v2
# --------------------
#   * Adeno_GSE185344 removed — the cohort was withdrawn from the study when
#     its only expression file proved to be a double-gzipped Seurat object.
#     Cohort count is now 18 (8 NEPC + 10 Adenocarcinoma), matching v8 of the
#     batch pipeline exactly.
#   * Author-annotation handling removed. Only the withdrawn GSE185344 RDS
#     carried depositor cell-type labels, so the optional
#     `author_<column>` partition path is gone; every cohort now uses the
#     pipeline's own `seurat_clusters`.
#
# WHAT CARRIED OVER FROM v2
#   * Reads the ALREADY-CLUSTERED seurat_merged.rds written into each cohort
#     folder — no raw-file loaders, no k-means, no PCA here. One clustering
#     algorithm, one parameter set, one partition definition for every cohort,
#     so tau values are comparable across datasets.
#   * Outputs written INTO each cohort folder.
#   * Writes the pooled tau_NEPC_all_datasets.csv and tau_Adeno_all_datasets.csv
#     that 06_ consumes.
#   * Distribution diagnostics against the 06_ hard cutoff (tau >= 0.95).
#   * Optional per-cluster specificity ratio table.
#
# OUTPUTS (per cohort folder)
#   <cohort>_tau.csv                 gene, tau, n_clusters, dataset, cohort_group
#   <cohort>_pseudobulk.rds          gene x cluster mean matrix
#   <cohort>_cluster_ratio.csv       gene x cluster specificity ratios (optional)
#   <cohort>_tau_distribution.pdf    histogram + 0.95 cutoff line
#
# OUTPUTS (root folders)
#   tau_NEPC_all_datasets.csv        <- consumed by 06_
#   tau_Adeno_all_datasets.csv       <- consumed by 06_
#   tau_<group>_per_dataset_long.csv audit trail
#   tau_run_log.csv
#   tau_threshold_diagnostics.csv
# ============================================================================

